          "quote": "In the Zr-based alloy system, the addition of trace amounts of Y or Y2O3 can achieve a significant grain refinement effect [32-34]. Taking the Zr-Mo-Al-Ti alloy as an example [34], with the addition of 2 wt.%, 3 wt.% and 4 wt.% of Y respectively, the average grain diameter of the alloy decreased successively from 101.6 μm (without Y) to 38 μm, 29.8 μm and 19.4 μm",
