          "section": "2.2 Multi-phase alloys",
          "quote": "For Nb-Si based alloys, this system represents a crucial class of refractory alloys designed based on refractory metal Nb. The primary constituent phases include the Nb solid solution (Nb SS) and silicides (Nb5Si3 or Nb3Si), with Nb5Si3 (with α, β, γ polymorphs) serving as the dominant strengthening phase.",
